{"3612110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "16 Cyber-Personalities: Survivors", "steam_appid": 3612110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what tiny creatures might be hiding in the corners of your mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by MBTI, <i>16 Cyber-Personalities: Survivors</i> invites you to open the curtain to a secret world—one far livelier than you ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, whimsical elemental sprites embody different facets of your personality. And when doubt or fear takes shape as invading forces, these adorable allies rise as your strongest mental defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what is your gaming MBTI? Step into the arena of your mind, forge powerful bonds, and let the adventure reveal the depths of your personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight elemental sprites correspond to the eight MBTI personality letters.<br>Each sprite can evolve twice and branches into four distinct evolution paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out your personal gaming personality type and use your unique personality skills to support your sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/a50c70b175f39b1537f73d0220c95588.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts under 10 minutes—jump in anytime, pump up your adrenaline, and sweep away the shadows in your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/cb34bbc8bc3ab4743aa9a4bc31c317d7.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1299 height=732 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match over 400 traits (items) to create a personality build that’s uniquely yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/119d19e7ad9891c8657f0b5465a0153d.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every personality can be customized with any of the 49 personality masks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/3c69e685a29058354872c5b3d81e1c07.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an out-of-run growth system inspired by Jung’s eight cognitive functions—feel the flow of psychic energy as you progress toward personality maturity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/afaf7579b6dffd3e2fb41bd39eb8ea95.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1560 height=881 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, enjoy a free in-game personality test!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/869e820cc80ca0dd2f81c7e221ff17ba.avif?t=1782716299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras_big/869e820cc80ca0dd2f81c7e221ff17ba.avif?t=1782716299 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what tiny creatures might be hiding in the corners of your mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by MBTI, <i>16 Cyber-Personalities: Survivors</i> invites you to open the curtain to a secret world—one far livelier than you ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, whimsical elemental sprites embody different facets of your personality. And when doubt or fear takes shape as invading forces, these adorable allies rise as your strongest mental defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what is your gaming MBTI? Step into the arena of your mind, forge powerful bonds, and let the adventure reveal the depths of your personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight elemental sprites correspond to the eight MBTI personality letters.<br>Each sprite can evolve twice and branches into four distinct evolution paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out your personal gaming personality type and use your unique personality skills to support your sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/a50c70b175f39b1537f73d0220c95588.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts under 10 minutes—jump in anytime, pump up your adrenaline, and sweep away the shadows in your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/cb34bbc8bc3ab4743aa9a4bc31c317d7.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1299 height=732 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match over 400 traits (items) to create a personality build that’s uniquely yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612110/extras/119d19e7ad9891c8657f0b5465a0153d.avif?t=1782716299\" width=1560 height=878 /></spa